window.docContents[76].resolve({"/Elementary-Functions/___4___3-Graphics/#LMLF-___-DLMF-with-Lean--Elementary-Functions--___4___3-Graphics--___4___3-Graphics--___4___3_LPAR_ii_RPAR_-Complex-Arguments___-Conformal-Maps":{"contents":"Source: DLMF §4.3(ii).\n\nw={\\mathrm e}^{z},\\qquad z=\\ln w. The strip -π < Im z < π maps under w=exp z onto the w-plane cut along\nthe negative real axis; log w is the principal value on that slit plane.\nHorizontal lines map to rays and vertical lines to circles centered at the\norigin.  For a positive real parameter r, the table in the source records\n0 ↦ 1, r ↦ eʳ, r+iπ ↦ -eʳ+i0, r−iπ ↦ -eʳ−i0,\niπ ↦ -1+i0, −iπ ↦ -1−i0, -r+iπ ↦ -e⁻ʳ+i0,\n-r−iπ ↦ -e⁻ʳ−i0, and -r ↦ e⁻ʳ.\n\n","context":"LMLF · DLMF with Lean\u0009Elementary Functions\u0009§4.3 Graphics\u0009§4.3 Graphics","header":"§4.3(ii) Complex Arguments: Conformal Maps","id":"/Elementary-Functions/___4___3-Graphics/#LMLF-___-DLMF-with-Lean--Elementary-Functions--___4___3-Graphics--___4___3-Graphics--___4___3_LPAR_ii_RPAR_-Complex-Arguments___-Conformal-Maps"},"/Incomplete-Gamma-and-Related-Functions/Chapter-contents/#LMLF-___-DLMF-with-Lean--Incomplete-Gamma-and-Related-Functions--Chapter-contents--Related-functions":{"contents":"* 8.17 Incomplete Beta Functions* 8.18 Asymptotic Expansions of the Incomplete Beta Function* 8.19 Generalized Exponential Integral* 8.20 Asymptotic Expansions of the Generalized Exponential Integral* 8.21 Generalized Sine and Cosine Integrals\n\n","context":"LMLF · DLMF with Lean\u0009Incomplete Gamma and Related Functions\u0009Chapter contents","header":"Related functions","id":"/Incomplete-Gamma-and-Related-Functions/Chapter-contents/#LMLF-___-DLMF-with-Lean--Incomplete-Gamma-and-Related-Functions--Chapter-contents--Related-functions"}});